From f9f5bed7c04e6da0948eb0142232c33fb8bc9574 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: refine P30E post-capabilities checkpoints

CPU8 retained the P30E capability checkpoint but did not reach
the existing target-valid checkpoint. The remaining interval
contains CPU postboot, CPU-info, expectation, and topology work.

Split those operations with target-owned monotonic checkpoints.
On expectation failure, retain the exact mismatch bitmap and
first expected/observed pair before the reason commit. Keep the
CPU request, CPU9 veto, CPU_OFF, retry, and power sequence
unchanged, and expose the detail through diagnostic ABI 5.
